# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# XAI-FLOWS Mobile — Local Configuration Template
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Copy this file to `local.properties` in the project root and fill in real
# values. `local.properties` is git-ignored and must NEVER be committed —
# only this .example template should be checked into version control.
#
# Android Studio also writes `sdk.dir=<path>` into your real local.properties
# automatically on first sync — don't add that line here, it's machine-
# specific and has nothing to do with these app secrets.
#
# Both keys below are OPTIONAL — each has a working fallback baked into
# app/build.gradle.kts, so the app builds and runs out of the box without a
# local.properties file at all. Set these to use your own Turnstile widget.

# ── Cloudflare Turnstile (CAPTCHA) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Public site key for the login/signup CAPTCHA widget — safe to be in the
# APK (it's the public half of the key pair). The matching *secret* key
# lives only in the backend's TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY and must never appear
# here. Get one at https://dash.cloudflare.com/?to=/:account/turnstile
#
# Falls back to an empty string if unset — login/register will fail
# CAPTCHA verification without a real key.
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# Real hosted page the Turnstile widget's WebView navigates to. There is no
# native Android Turnstile SDK, so this loads Cloudflare's actual widget
# inside a WebView — it must be a real, dashboard-allow-listed hostname (a
# bundled local asset does not satisfy Cloudflare's mobile-implementation
# requirements). Falls back to the frontend repo's deployed
# public/mobile-turnstile.html if unset — only override for local testing
# against a different deployment (e.g. a preview URL).
TURNSTILE_WIDGET_URL=https://app.ubada.org/mobile-turnstile.html
